            rl-row("R38", "switches", "reconcile", "FORM_KERNEL_STACK_MB defaults diverge across kernel arms", "released", "audited, zero edits: the two numbers were never coupled -- TS's 2048 (6e4fd615, 2026-07-17) predates the emitted walker's stack launcher entirely (2026-08-23); main.ts's own comment claims only mechanism parity (same env door, matched V8 limit, loud failure), never numeric equality, so nothing false to fix. Four arms, four different numbers (256 seed/Rust, 2048 TS, 4096 emitted-C, unbounded Go), each answering a different frame-cost question under a different stress workload"),
